{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"lesson-english-v2-001","sequence":1,"step":{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:step:establish-sentence","purpose":"明确本课知识点和两个核心问题，再呈现完整例句","beats":[{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:step:establish-sentence:beat:show-sentence-and-goal","narration":{"text":"这节课只解决一个知识点：that 引导的定语从句。围绕例句，我们回答两个问题：that you gave me 修饰谁？that 在从句里充当什么成分？","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:action:1:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:topic-card","kind":"note","role":"task","content":{"title":"本课核心：that 引导的定语从句","items":["that you gave me 修饰哪个词？","that 在从句里充当什么成分？"]},"placement":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"lesson-origin"}}},{"action_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:action:1:1:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:original-sentence","kind":"text","role":"problem","content":{"fragments":[{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:original-sentence:fragment:subject-head","text":"The book "},{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:original-sentence:fragment:relative-clause","text":"that you gave me "},{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:original-sentence:fragment:main-verb","text":"was "},{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:original-sentence:fragment:subject-complement","text":"fascinating."}],"caption":"例句：The book that you gave me was fascinating."},"placement":{"relation":"below","align":"start","gap":"normal","anchor":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:topic-card"}}},{"action_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:action:1:1:3","op":"board.group","group":{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:group:task-group","title":"课题与例句","role":"task","members":["lesson-english-v2-001:node:topic-card","lesson-english-v2-001:node:original-sentence"]}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:action:1:1:4","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["lesson-english-v2-001:group:task-group"],"intent":"identify_lesson_question"}}]}},{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:step:establish-sentence:beat:bracket-relative-clause","narration":{"text":"先把 that you gave me 看成一个整体。它夹在 book 和主句动词 was 之间，暂时给它加上括号，稍后再打开。","delivery":"careful"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:action:1:2:1","op":"board.emphasize","target":{"node_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:original-sentence","fragment_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:original-sentence:fragment:relative-clause"},"emphasis":"focus"},{"action_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:action:1:2:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"lesson-english-v2-001:node:clause-bracket","kind":"note","role":"observation","content":{"title":"① 第一步：先圈出中间块","text":"[ that you gave me ] 暂时整体拿开，寻找外层主句。"},"placement":{"relation":"below","align":"start","gap":"spacious","anchor":"lesson-english-v2-001:group:task-group"}}}],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"lesson-english-v2-001:action:1:2:3","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["lesson-english-v2-001:node:original-sentence","lesson-english-v2-001:node:clause-bracket"],"intent":"bracket_middle_clause"}}]}}]}}
